# README must stay current

Whenever you change product name, version, install/share flow, engines, packaging, extension metadata, menu-bar behavior, or user-facing features, update `README.md` in the same change.

Also update `SHARE.md` when the friend-install path changes (pkg name, Open at Login, extension install steps, paths).

Do not leave docs describing Listen TTS, Speechify, or outdated Load-unpacked steps if the app now automates part of that flow.
